    "outcome": "Build compiled Python extensions and reusable atomic Rust cdylibs in platform wheels with checksums, versioned C ABI, parity tests and adoption guidance for nl-* consumers.",
    "nonGoals": [
      "Migrate existing consumer repositories, create remote repositories or publish to registries.",
